RRB.load({"id":"gd-2026-feb-09-s3","exam":"gd","label":"Group D · 9 Feb 2026 · Shift 3","time":"4:30 PM - 6:00 PM","dropped":0,"questions":[{"s":"General Science","q":"Which structure in Rhizopus is directly involved in the process of reproduction through spore formation?","o":["Hyphae","Mycelium","Sporangia","Rhizoids"],"a":2,"e":"Rhizopus forms spores inside sporangia, the knob-like structures on its hyphae.","qh":"राइजोपस में कौन-सी संरचना, बीजाणु निर्माण के माध्यम से प्रजनन की प्रक्रिया में प्रत्यक्ष रूप से शामिल होती है?","oh":["हाइपी (Hyphae)","कवकजाल (Mycelium)","बीजाणुधानी (Sporangia)","मूलाभास (Rhizoids)"],"eh":"राइजोपस अपने कवक तंतुओं पर स्थित घुंडीनुमा संरचनाओं, बीजाणुधानियों के अंदर बीजाणु बनाता है।"},{"s":"General Science","q":"Which property enables carbon to form long chains?","o":["Polymerisation","Catenation","Tetravalency","Isomerism"],"a":1,"e":"Catenation is carbon's ability to bond with other carbon atoms to form long chains and rings.","qh":"कौन-सा गुणधर्म कार्बन को दीर्घ शृंखलाएं बनाने में सक्षम बनाता है?","oh":["बहुलकीकरण (Polymerisation)","श्रृंखलन (Catenation)","चतुः संयोजकता (Tetravalency)","समावयवता (Isomerism)"],"eh":"श्रृंखलन (कैटेनेशन) कार्बन का वह गुण है जिससे वह अन्य कार्बन परमाणुओं से जुड़कर लंबी श्रृंखलाएँ और वलय बनाता है।"},{"s":"General Science","q":"A sound wave has a speed of 320 m/s. If the wavelength of the wave is 0.4 m, what is the frequency of this wave?","o":["128 Hz","80 Hz","1280 Hz","800 Hz"],"a":3,"e":"f = v/λ = 320/0.4 = 800 Hz.","qh":"एक ध्वनि तरंग की चाल 320 m/s है। यदि तरंग की तरंगदैर्ध्य 0.4 m है, तो इस तरंग की आवृत्ति कितनी है?","oh":["128 Hz","80 Hz","1280 Hz","800 Hz"],"eh":"f = v/λ = 320/0.4 = 800 Hz।"},{"s":"General Science","q":"The filament of a light bulb is made up of tungsten, because of its ______.","o":["High resistance and low melting point","High resistance and high melting point","Low resistance and low melting point","Low resistance and high melting point"],"a":1,"e":"Tungsten has high resistance (so it glows) and a very high melting point (about 3380 °C).","qh":"प्रकाश बल्ब का फिलामेंट टंगस्टन से बना होता है, क्योंकि यह ______ वाला होता है।","eh":"टंगस्टन का प्रतिरोध अधिक होता है (इसलिए यह चमकता है) और इसका गलनांक बहुत अधिक (लगभग 3380 °C) होता है।"},{"s":"General Science","q":"In plants, food made in leaves is transported to other parts by the complex tissue called __________.","o":["Phloem","Sclerenchyma","Xylem","Collenchyma"],"a":0,"e":"Phloem carries the food made in leaves (translocation).","qh":"पादपों में, पत्तियों में बना भोजन ___________ नामक जटिल ऊतक द्वारा अन्य भागों में पहुँचाया जाता है।","oh":["फ्लोएम (Phloem)","द्दढ़ोतक (Sclerenchyma)","ज़ाइलम (Xylem)","कॉलेन्काइमा (Collenchyma)"],"eh":"फ्लोएम पत्तियों में बने भोजन का परिवहन (स्थानांतरण) करता है।"},{"s":"General Science","q":"A sealed syringe containing air is pressed from one end while keeping the other end closed. What is the most likely outcome of this action in terms of the state of air inside the syringe?","o":["The volume of air increases and pressure decreases","The air escapes completely from the syringe","The volume of air decreases and its pressure increases","The temperature of air inside drops significantly"],"a":2,"e":"Gases are compressible: pushing the plunger reduces the volume, so the pressure rises.","qh":"एक सीलबंद सिरिंज जिसमें वायु भरी हुई है, के एक सिरे पर दाब आरोपित किया जाता है जबकि दूसरे सिरे को बंद रखा जाता है। सिरिंज के अंदर वायु की स्थिति के संदर्भ में इस क्रिया का सबसे संभावित परिणाम क्या होगा?","eh":"गैसें संपीड्य होती हैं: प्लंजर दबाने से आयतन घटता है, इसलिए दाब बढ़ता है।"},{"s":"General Science","q":"A constant force acts on an object of mass 4 kg for a duration of 2 s, increasing its velocity from 2 m/s to 8 m/s. If the same force is applied for a duration of 4 s, then what would be the final velocity of the object?","o":["14 m/s","10 m/s","20 m/s","12 m/s"],"a":0,"e":"a = 6/2 = 3 m/s². In 4 s, v = 2 + 3 × 4 = 14 m/s.","qh":"4 kg द्रव्यमान की किसी वस्तु पर 2 s की अवधि के लिए एक नियत बल कार्य करता है, जिससे उसका वेग 2 m/s से बढ़कर 8 m/s हो जाता है। यदि यही बल 4 s की अवधि के लिए प्रयुक्त किया जाए, तो वस्तु का अंतिम वेग कितना होगा?","oh":["14 m/s","10 m/s","20 m/s","12 m/s"],"eh":"a = 6/2 = 3 m/s²। 4 s में, v = 2 + 3 × 4 = 14 m/s।"},{"s":"General Science","q":"A boy lifts an object above his head by exerting a force. Which of the following works is negative?","o":["Work done by the force of gravity","Work done by the boy","Work done by the object","Work done by the applied force"],"a":0,"e":"Gravity acts downward while the object moves up, so the work done by gravity is negative.","qh":"एक लड़का बल लगाकर किसी वस्तु को अपने सिर के ऊपर उठाता है। निम्नलिखित में से कौन-सा कार्य ऋणात्मक है?","eh":"गुरुत्व नीचे की ओर कार्य करता है जबकि वस्तु ऊपर जाती है, इसलिए गुरुत्व द्वारा किया गया कार्य ऋणात्मक होता है।"},{"s":"General Science","q":"Which of the following is the correct unit of average speed in SI system?","o":["km/h²","m/s²","s/m²","m/s"],"a":3,"e":"Speed = distance/time, so the SI unit is m/s.","qh":"SI पद्धति में औसत चाल का सही मात्रक निम्नलिखित में से क्या है?","eh":"चाल = दूरी/समय, अतः SI मात्रक m/s है।"},{"s":"General Science","q":"Which of the following is NOT an olfactory indicator?","o":["Vanilla","Onion","Litmus","Clove oil"],"a":2,"e":"Litmus is a visual (colour) indicator. Vanilla, onion and clove oil are olfactory (smell) indicators.","qh":"निम्नलिखित में से कौन-सा, घ्राण सूचक नहीं है?","oh":["वैनिला (Vanilla)","प्याज (Onion)","लिटमस (Litmus)","लवंग तेल (Clove oil)"],"eh":"लिटमस एक दृश्य (रंग) सूचक है। वनीला, प्याज और लौंग का तेल गंधीय सूचक हैं।"},{"s":"General Science","q":"Which of the following statements is true about weight and mass?","o":["Only weight changes on the Moon","Only mass changes on the Moon","Neither mass nor weight changes on the Moon","Both mass and weight change on the Moon"],"a":0,"e":"Mass stays constant. Weight = mg changes on the Moon because g is about 1/6.","qh":"भार और द्रव्यमान के संबंध में निम्नलिखित में से कौन-सा कथन सत्य है?","oh":["चंद्रमा पर केवल भार में परिवर्तन होता है।","चंद्रमा पर केवल द्रव्यमान में परिवर्तन होता है।","चंद्रमा पर न तो द्रव्यमान और न ही भार में परिवर्तन होता है।","चंद्रमा पर द्रव्यमान और भार दोनों में परिवर्तन होता है।"],"eh":"द्रव्यमान स्थिर रहता है। भार = mg चंद्रमा पर बदल जाता है क्योंकि वहाँ g लगभग 1/6 है।"},{"s":"General Science","q":"During a nerve impulse transmission, neurotransmitters are released from one neuron and received by another. Which part of neurons are primarily involved in this chemical communication?","o":["Axon → Myelin sheath of nerve","Axon terminal → Dendrite of another neuron","Cell body → Axon of same neuron","Dendrite → Axon terminal of same neuron"],"a":1,"e":"At a synapse, the axon terminal releases neurotransmitters, which the next neuron's dendrites receive.","qh":"तंत्रिका आवेग संचरण के दौरान, न्यूरोट्रांसमीटर एक तंत्रिकोशिका से निकलते हैं और दूसरी तंत्रिकोशिका द्वारा ग्रहण किए जाते हैं। तंत्रिकोशिका का कौन-सा भाग मुख्यतः इस रासायनिक संचार में शामिल होता है?","eh":"सिनैप्स पर तंत्रिकाक्ष का अंतिम सिरा तंत्रिका संचारक मुक्त करता है, जिन्हें अगले न्यूरॉन की द्रुमिकाएँ ग्रहण करती हैं।"},{"s":"General Science","q":"During the birth, the ovaries of a girl child contain ____________.","o":["Only mature eggs","Both mature and immature eggs","Only immature eggs","No eggs"],"a":2,"e":"At birth a girl's ovaries hold thousands of immature eggs. They begin maturing at puberty.","qh":"जन्म के समय, बालिका के अंडाशय में ________________ होते हैं।","oh":["केवल परिपक अंडे","परिपक और अपरिपक दोनों अंडे","केवल अपरिपक अंडे","कोई अंडे नहीं"],"eh":"जन्म के समय बालिका के अंडाशयों में हजारों अपरिपक्व अंडाणु होते हैं। ये यौवनारंभ पर परिपक्व होना शुरू करते हैं।"},{"s":"General Science","q":"In a toaster, the heating wire glows red because __________.","o":["The current is very high.","It resists the current and gets hot.","It has low melting point.","It has zero resistance."],"a":1,"e":"The nichrome element's high resistance turns electrical energy into heat (Joule heating), so it glows.","qh":"टोस्टर में, तापन तार (heating wire) लाल दीप्त होता है क्योंकि __________।","eh":"नाइक्रोम तत्व का उच्च प्रतिरोध विद्युत ऊर्जा को ऊष्मा में बदलता है (जूल तापन), इसलिए यह चमकता है।"},{"s":"General Science","q":"Read the following statements carefully and select the correct option. Assertion (A): Keeping oily food in airtight containers prevents rancidity. Reason (R): Airtight containers slow down the oxidation of fats and oils.","o":["Both A and R are true, and R is not the correct explanation of A.","A is true, but R is false.","Both A and R are true, and R is the correct explanation of A.","A is false, but R is true."],"a":2,"e":"Rancidity is the oxidation of fats. Airtight containers keep out oxygen, so R correctly explains A.","qh":"निम्नलिखित कथनों को ध्यानपूर्वक पढ़ें और सही विकल्प चुनें। अभिकथन (A): तैलीय खाद्य पदार्थों को वायुरोधी बर्तनों में रखने से उनका खराब होना रुक जाता है। कारण (R): वायुरोधी बर्तन वसा और तेलों के ऑक्सीकरण को धीमा कर देते हैं।","eh":"विकृतगंधिता वसा का ऑक्सीकरण है। वायुरुद्ध पात्र ऑक्सीजन को बाहर रखते हैं, अतः R, A की सही व्याख्या करता है।"},{"s":"General Science","q":"How does the space between particles change from solid to gas?","o":["The space increases as matter changes from solid to gas","Solids and gases always have equal spacing","The space remains unchanged during the change in states of matter","The space decreases as matter changes from solid to gas"],"a":0,"e":"Particles move further apart from solid to liquid to gas.","qh":"ठोस से गैस अवस्था में परिवर्तन पर कणों के बीच का स्थान किस प्रकार बदलता है?","eh":"ठोस से द्रव और द्रव से गैस में कण एक-दूसरे से अधिक दूर होते जाते हैं।"},{"s":"General Science","q":"Which of the following symbols is used for the element phosphorus as per the rules for atomic symbols?","o":["Pr","P","Ph","Ps"],"a":1,"e":"Phosphorus has the symbol P.","qh":"\" परमाण्विक प्रतीकों के नियमों के अनुसार, निम्नलिखित में से किस प्रतीक को तत्व फॉस्फोरस के लिए प्रयुक्त किया जाता है?","oh":["Pr","P","Ph","Ps"],"eh":"फॉस्फोरस का प्रतीक P है।"},{"s":"General Science","q":"What is the general name of the reaction between an acid and a base?","o":["Oxidation","Combustion","Neutralisation","Decomposition"],"a":2,"e":"Acid + base → salt + water is called neutralisation.","qh":"अम्ल और क्षार के बीच अभिक्रिया का सामान्य नाम क्या है?","eh":"अम्ल + क्षारक → लवण + जल को उदासीनीकरण कहते हैं।"},{"s":"General Science","q":"The complex tissue that transports food in plants is called __________, and it consists of living cells like sieve tubes and __________.","o":["Xylem, tracheids","Collenchyma, sclerenchyma","Phloem, companion cells","Xylem, xylem fibres"],"a":2,"e":"Phloem conducts food. It has sieve tubes, companion cells, phloem parenchyma and fibres.","qh":"पादपों में भोजन का परिवहन करने वाले जटिल ऊतक को __________ कहा जाता है, और इसमें चालनी नलिकाएँ (sieve tubes) और __________ जैसी जीवित कोशिकाएँ होती हैं।","eh":"फ्लोएम भोजन का संवहन करता है। इसमें चालनी नलिकाएँ, सहचर कोशिकाएँ, फ्लोएम मृदूतक और फ्लोएम रेशे होते हैं।"},{"s":"General Science","q":"Based on the reactivity series, which of the following metals is the least reactive?","o":["Au (gold)","Ca (calcium)","Fe (iron)","K (potassium)"],"a":0,"e":"Gold is at the bottom of the reactivity series, so it is the least reactive.","qh":"अभिक्रियता श्रेणी के आधार पर, निम्नलिखित में से कौन-सी धातु अल्पतम अभिक्रियाशील है?","oh":["Au (सोना)","Ca (कैल्सियम)","Fe (लोहा)","K (पोटैशियम)"],"eh":"सोना सक्रियता श्रेणी में सबसे नीचे है, इसलिए यह सबसे कम सक्रिय है।"},{"s":"General Science","q":"A real and inverted image is formed at a distance of 30 cm from a concave mirror when the object is placed 40 cm from the mirror. What will be the magnification produced by the mirror?","o":["- 4/3","- 3/4","+ 3/4","+ 4/3"],"a":1,"e":"m = −v/u = −(−30)/(−40) = −3/4 (real and inverted).","qh":"जब बिंब को अवतल दर्पण से 40 cm की दूरी पर रखा जाता है, तो बिंब का वास्तविक और उल्टा प्रतिबिंब, दर्पण से 30 cm की दूरी पर बनता है। दर्पण द्वारा उत्पन्न आवर्धन कितना होगा?","eh":"m = −v/u = −(−30)/(−40) = −3/4 (वास्तविक और उल्टा)।"},{"s":"General Science","q":"A student shows a concave lens forming a diminished real image on the screen. The mistake is:","o":["Concave lens cannot form a real image","Concave lens cannot form a magnified image","Concave lens does not refract light","Concave lens always converges light"],"a":0,"e":"A concave lens always forms a virtual, erect, diminished image, never a real one.","qh":"एक विद्यार्थी, अवतल लेंस द्वारा पर्दे पर निर्मित किए गए एक छोटे वास्तविक प्रतिबिंब को दर्शाता है। इसमें क्या गलती है?","eh":"अवतल लेंस सदैव आभासी, सीधा और छोटा प्रतिबिंब बनाता है, कभी वास्तविक नहीं।"},{"s":"General Science","q":"Which connective tissue is known for supporting internal organs?","o":["Squamous epithelium","Ligament","Tendon","Areolar tissue"],"a":3,"e":"Areolar connective tissue fills spaces in organs and supports them.","qh":"कौन-सा संयोजी ऊतक, आंतरिक अंगों को सपोर्ट प्रदान करता है?","eh":"एरियोलर संयोजी ऊतक अंगों के बीच के रिक्त स्थानों को भरता है और उन्हें सहारा देता है।"},{"s":"General Science","q":"The disease-causing pathogens in plants can be transmitted through______.","o":["Air","Soil","Both Soil and Air","Neither Soil nor Air"],"a":2,"e":"Plant pathogens spread through air, water, soil and vectors, so both soil and air.","qh":"पौधों में रोग-जनक रोगाणु ______ के माध्यम से संचारित हो सकते हैं।","eh":"पादप रोगजनक वायु, जल, मृदा और रोगवाहकों द्वारा फैलते हैं, अतः मृदा और वायु दोनों।"},{"s":"General Science","q":"A scientist observed a multicellular organism undergoing reproduction. Which of the following methods would the plant NOT be using?","o":["Fragmentation","Binary Fission","Vegetative Propagation","Budding"],"a":1,"e":"Binary fission is the method of unicellular organisms. A multicellular plant would not use it.","qh":"एक वैज्ञानिक ने एक बहुकोशिकीय जीव में प्रजनन प्रक्रिया का अवलोकन किया। निम्नलिखित में से कौन- सी विधि पौधे द्वारा उपयोग नहीं की जाएगी?","oh":["खंडन (Fragmentation)","द्वि-खंडन (Binary Fission)","कायिक प्रवर्धन (Vegetative Propagation)","मुकुलन (Budding)"],"eh":"द्विखंडन एककोशिकीय जीवों की जनन विधि है। बहुकोशिकीय पौधा इसका उपयोग नहीं करेगा।"},{"s":"Mathematics","q":"A man receives ₹9475 per month as salary. He saves 88% of his salary every month. His expenditure per month is:","o":["₹1053","₹1137","₹1168","₹1114"],"a":1,"e":"Expenditure = 12% of 9475 = ₹1,137.","qh":"एक व्यक्ति का मासिक वेतन ₹9475 है। वह प्रति माह अपने वेतन का 88% बचत करता है। उसका मासिक व्यय ज्ञात कीजिए।","oh":["₹1053","₹1137","₹1168","₹1114"],"eh":"व्यय = 9475 का 12% = ₹1,137।"},{"s":"Mathematics","q":"In an election with three candidates, M, N and R, candidate M secured 42% of the total votes, while candidate R obtained 34%. If the total number of votes polled was 37,700 and all were valid, how many votes did candidate N receive?","o":["9048","9164","9100","9000"],"a":0,"e":"N got 100 − 42 − 34 = 24%, and 24% of 37700 = 9,048.","qh":"तीन उम्मीदवारों, M, N और R, वाले एक चुनाव में, उम्मीदवार M को कुल मतों में से 42% मत प्राप्त हुए, जबकि उम्मीदवार R को 34% मत प्राप्त हुए। यदि कुल डाले गए मतों की संख्या 37,700 थी और सभी मत वैध थे, तो उम्मीदवार N को कितने मत प्राप्त हुए?","oh":["9048","9164","9100","9000"],"eh":"N को 100 − 42 − 34 = 24% मिले, और 37700 का 24% = 9,048।"},{"s":"Mathematics","q":"","o":["51","85","72","95"],"a":1,"img":"data/img/gd-2026-feb-09-s3/028ma-q0.png","e":"√(121 × 49) = 77, √(64 × 36) = 48 and √(100 × 16) = 40, so 77 + 48 − 40 = 85.","oh":["51","85","72","95"],"eh":"√(121 × 49) = 77, √(64 × 36) = 48 और √(100 × 16) = 40, अतः 77 + 48 − 40 = 85।"},{"s":"Mathematics","q":"The speed of a train 200 m long is 50 km/hr. How much time will it take to pass a platform 600 m long?","o":["57.6 sec","57 sec","56 sec","55 sec"],"a":0,"e":"Distance = 800 m and speed = 50 × 5/18 = 125/9 m/s, so time = 57.6 s.","qh":"200 m लंबी एक ट्रेन की चाल 50 km/hr है। 600 m लंबे एक प्लेटफार्म को पार करने में उसे कितना समय लगेगा?","oh":["57.6 sec","57 sec","56 sec","55 sec"],"eh":"दूरी = 800 m और चाल = 50 × 5/18 = 125/9 m/s, अतः समय = 57.6 s।"},{"s":"Mathematics","q":"","o":["10 years","15 years","18 years","20 years"],"a":0,"img":"data/img/gd-2026-feb-09-s3/030ma-q0.png","e":"F = 4d and 4d − 5 = 7(d − 5), so 3d = 30 and d = 10 years.","oh":["10 वर्ष","15 वर्ष","18 वर्ष","20 वर्ष"],"eh":"F = 4d और 4d − 5 = 7(d − 5), अतः 3d = 30 और d = 10 वर्ष।"},{"s":"Mathematics","q":"A table is bought for ₹1,400 and sold at a loss of 6%. Find its selling price.","o":["₹1,310","₹1,312","₹1,314","₹1,316"],"a":3,"e":"SP = 1400 × 0.94 = ₹1,316.","qh":"एक मेज ₹1,400 में खरीदी गई और 6% की हानि पर बेची गई। उसका विक्रय मूल्य ज्ञात कीजिए।","oh":["₹1,310","₹1,312","₹1,314","₹1,316"],"eh":"विक्रय मूल्य = 1400 × 0.94 = ₹1,316।"},{"s":"Mathematics","q":"A and B started moving at the same time towards each other from points X and Y, respectively. After meeting on the way, A and B took 95.4 hours and p hours, respectively, to reach Y and X, respectively. If the speed of B is 50% more than that of A, then what is the value of p?","o":["44.5","40.4","43.8","42.4"],"a":3,"e":"tA/tB = (vB/vA)² = 1.5² = 2.25, so p = 95.4/2.25 = 42.4 hours.","qh":"A और B एक ही समय पर क्रमशः X और Y बिंदुओं से एक-दूसरे की ओर चलना शुरू करते हैं। रास्ते में मिलने के बाद, A और B को क्रमशः Y और X तक पहुँचने में क्रमशः 95.4 घंटे और p घंटे लगते हैं। यदि B की चाल, A की चाल से 50% अधिक है, तो p का मान कितना है?","oh":["44.5","40.4","43.8","42.4"],"eh":"tA/tB = (vB/vA)² = 1.5² = 2.25, अतः p = 95.4/2.25 = 42.4 घंटे।"},{"s":"Mathematics","q":"₹9,975 is divided among A, B, C and D in such a way that the shares of A and B, B and C, and C and D are in the ratios of 2 : 3, 4 : 5 and 6 : 7, respectively. The share of A (in ₹) is:","o":["1,520","1,460","1,490","1,560"],"a":0,"e":"A : B : C : D = 16 : 24 : 30 : 35 (total 105), so A = 9975 × 16/105 = ₹1,520.","qh":"₹9,975 को A, B, C और D के बीच इस प्रकार विभाजित किया जाता है कि A और B के हिस्से, B और C के हिस्से, तथा C और D के हिस्से क्रमशः 2 : 3, 4 : 5 और 6 : 7 के अनुपात में हैं। A का हिस्सा (₹ में) ज्ञात कीजिए।","oh":["1,520","1,460","1,490","1,560"],"eh":"A : B : C : D = 16 : 24 : 30 : 35 (कुल 105), अतः A = 9975 × 16/105 = ₹1,520।"},{"s":"Mathematics","q":"","o":["","","",""],"a":2,"img":"data/img/gd-2026-feb-09-s3/034ma-q0.png","oi":["data/img/gd-2026-feb-09-s3/034ma-o1.png","data/img/gd-2026-feb-09-s3/034ma-o2.png","data/img/gd-2026-feb-09-s3/034ma-o3.png","data/img/gd-2026-feb-09-s3/034ma-o4.png"],"e":"tan 10° × tan 80° = 1 and tan 18° × tan 72° = 1 (since tan θ × tan(90° − θ) = 1), so the product = 1.","eh":"tan 10° × tan 80° = 1 और tan 18° × tan 72° = 1 (क्योंकि tan θ × tan(90° − θ) = 1), अतः गुणनफल = 1।"},{"s":"Mathematics","q":"","o":["","","",""],"a":0,"img":"data/img/gd-2026-feb-09-s3/035ma-q0.png","oi":["data/img/gd-2026-feb-09-s3/035ma-o1.png","data/img/gd-2026-feb-09-s3/035ma-o2.png","data/img/gd-2026-feb-09-s3/035ma-o3.png","data/img/gd-2026-feb-09-s3/035ma-o4.png"],"e":"(3x² + 4x²) ÷ 7x = 7x² ÷ 7x = x.","eh":"(3x² + 4x²) ÷ 7x = 7x² ÷ 7x = x।"},{"s":"Mathematics","q":"The amount on a sum of ₹9,400 at 20% per annum compound interest, compounded annually, in 2 years will be:","o":["₹12,838","₹13,536","₹13,189","₹14,133"],"a":1,"e":"9400 × 1.2² = 9400 × 1.44 = ₹13,536.","qh":"₹9,400 की राशि पर वार्षिक रूप से संयोजित 20% वार्षिक चक्रवृद्धि ब्याज की दर से 2 वर्षों में प्राप्त मिश्रधन ज्ञात कीजिए।","oh":["₹12,838","₹13,536","₹13,189","₹14,133"],"eh":"9400 × 1.2² = 9400 × 1.44 = ₹13,536।"},{"s":"Mathematics","q":"Pipe A can fill a tank in 33 minutes and Pipe B can fill it in 22 minutes. Pipe C empties it. If all of the pipes are opened together, the tank will be full in 55 minutes. In how many minutes will pipe C empty the full tank?","o":["","","",""],"a":3,"oi":["data/img/gd-2026-feb-09-s3/037ma-o1.png","data/img/gd-2026-feb-09-s3/037ma-o2.png","data/img/gd-2026-feb-09-s3/037ma-o3.png","data/img/gd-2026-feb-09-s3/037ma-o4.png"],"e":"1/C = 1/33 + 1/22 − 1/55 = 19/330, so C = 330/19 = 17 7/19 min.","qh":"पाइप A एक टंकी को 33 मिनट में भर सकता है और पाइप B उसे 22 मिनट में भर सकता है। पाइप C इसे खाली कर सकता है। यदि सभी पाइप एक साथ खोल दिए जाएं, तो टंकी 55 मिनट में भर जाएगी। पाइप C भरी हुई टंकी को कितने मिनट में खाली कर देगी?","eh":"1/C = 1/33 + 1/22 − 1/55 = 19/330, अतः C = 330/19 = 17 7/19 मिनट।"},{"s":"Mathematics","q":"A shopkeeper fixed the marked price of an article as ₹2,40,000. He gave 30% and 18% successive discounts on one article and 48% discount on another article of the same marked price. On which of the two articles did the shopkeeper get more benefit and how much more was it?","o":["Second article; ₹10,960","Second article; ₹12,800","First article; ₹12,960","First article; ₹11,560"],"a":2,"e":"First article: 240000 × 0.7 × 0.82 = 137760. Second: 240000 × 0.52 = 124800. The first fetches ₹12,960 more.","qh":"एक दुकानदार ने एक वस्तु का अंकित मूल्य ₹2,40,000 निर्धारित किया। उसने एक (पहली) वस्तु पर 30% और 18% की क्रमिक छूट दी तथा समान अंकित मूल्य वाली दूसरी वस्तु पर 48% की छूट दी। दुकानदार को दोनों वस्तुओं में से किस वस्तु पर अधिक लाभ हुआ और कितना हुआ?","oh":["दूसरी वस्तु; ₹10,960","दूसरी वस्तु; ₹12,800","पहली वस्तु; ₹12,960","पहली वस्तु; ₹11,560"],"eh":"पहली वस्तु: 240000 × 0.7 × 0.82 = 137760। दूसरी: 240000 × 0.52 = 124800। पहली से ₹12,960 अधिक मिलते हैं।"},{"s":"Mathematics","q":"An item is sold for ₹8,900 after two successive discounts of 20% and 11%. What is the marked price (in ₹) of the item?","o":["12,670","12,495","12,525","12,500"],"a":3,"e":"MP = 8900 ÷ (0.8 × 0.89) = 8900 ÷ 0.712 = ₹12,500.","qh":"एक वस्तु को 20% और 11% की दो क्रमिक छूट के बाद ₹8,900 में बेचा जाता है। वस्तु का अंकित मूल्य (₹ में) कितना है?","oh":["12,670","12,495","12,525","12,500"],"eh":"अंकित मूल्य = 8900 ÷ (0.8 × 0.89) = 8900 ÷ 0.712 = ₹12,500।"},{"s":"Mathematics","q":"The sum of the first pair of two-digit twin prime numbers is:","o":["22","26","24","28"],"a":2,"e":"The first two-digit twin primes are 11 and 13: 11 + 13 = 24.","qh":"दो-अंकों वाली अभाज्य युग्म संख्याओं (twin prime number) के पहले युग्म का योगफल ज्ञात कीजिए।","oh":["22","26","24","28"],"eh":"पहले दो अंकों वाले अभाज्य युग्म 11 और 13 हैं: 11 + 13 = 24।"},{"s":"Mathematics","q":"If 66 is the mean proportion between x and 99, what is the value of x?","o":["43","42","44","46"],"a":2,"e":"66² = 99x, so x = 4356/99 = 44.","qh":"यदि x और 99 का माध्यानुपाती 66 है, तो x का मान ज्ञात कीजिए।","oh":["43","42","44","46"],"eh":"66² = 99x, अतः x = 4356/99 = 44।"},{"s":"Mathematics","q":"What is the smallest natural number that should be added to 9054 such that a remainder of 6 is left when the resulting number is divided by each of the numbers 28, 24, 56 and 29?","o":["696","678","710","695"],"a":0,"e":"LCM(28, 24, 56, 29) = 4872. The next number above 9054 of the form 4872k + 6 is 9750, so add 9750 − 9054 = 696.","qh":"वह सबसे छोटी प्राकृत संख्या कौन-सी है जिसे 9054 में जोड़ा जाए जिससे परिणामी संख्या को 28, 24, 56 और 29 में से प्रत्येक से विभाजित करने पर शेषफल 6 बचे?","oh":["696","678","710","695"],"eh":"LCM(28, 24, 56, 29) = 4872। 9054 से बड़ी 4872k + 6 रूप की अगली संख्या 9750 है, अतः 9750 − 9054 = 696 जोड़ें।"},{"s":"Mathematics","q":"The area of a rectangle gets reduced by 21 m² if its length is reduced by 7 m and breadth is increased by 5 m and if its length is increased by 4 m and breadth is increased by 5 m, the area is increased by 67 m². Find the original area of the rectangle.","o":["21.8 m²","12.8 m²","15.6 m²","21 m²"],"a":3,"e":"5l − 7b = 14 and 5l + 4b = 47, so b = 3 and l = 7. Area = 21 m².","qh":"यदि एक आयत की लंबाई 7 m कम कर दी जाए और चौड़ाई 5 m बढ़ा दी जाए, तो उसका क्षेत्रफल 21 2 m कम हो जाता है, तथा यदि उसकी लंबाई 4 m बढ़ा दी जाए और चौड़ाई 5 m बढ़ा दी जाए, तो क्षेत्रफल 2 67 m बढ़ जाता है। आयत का मूल क्षेत्रफल ज्ञात कीजिए।","oh":["21.8 m²","12.8 m²","15.6 m²","21 m²"],"eh":"5l − 7b = 14 और 5l + 4b = 47, अतः b = 3 और l = 7। क्षेत्रफल = 21 m²।"},{"s":"Mathematics","q":"","o":["","","",""],"a":2,"img":"data/img/gd-2026-feb-09-s3/044ma-q0.png","oi":["data/img/gd-2026-feb-09-s3/044ma-o1.png","data/img/gd-2026-feb-09-s3/044ma-o2.png","data/img/gd-2026-feb-09-s3/044ma-o3.png","data/img/gd-2026-feb-09-s3/044ma-o4.png"],"e":"2c + 3k = 36 and c + 2k = 23, so k = 10 and c = 3. 4c + 5k = 12 + 50 = ₹62.","eh":"2c + 3k = 36 और c + 2k = 23, अतः k = 10 और c = 3। 4c + 5k = 12 + 50 = ₹62।"},{"s":"Mathematics","q":"What is the mode of the following data? 65, 86, 86, 85, 69, 90, 71, 60, 86, 71, 86, 65, 81, 82, 67, 72, 84, 66, 75, 85, 68, 78, 61, 64, 74, 90","o":["69","86","65","85"],"a":1,"e":"86 appears 4 times, more than any other value.","qh":"निम्नलिखित डेटा का बहुलक कितना है? 65, 86, 86, 85, 69, 90, 71, 60, 86, 71, 86, 65, 81, 82, 67, 72, 84, 66, 75, 85, 68, 78, 61, 64, 74, 90","oh":["69","86","65","85"],"eh":"86 चार बार आता है, जो किसी भी अन्य मान से अधिक है।"},{"s":"Mathematics","q":"The expenditure of Sudha is 100% more than her savings. If her expenditure decreases by 4% and savings increase by 35%, then by what percent does her income increase?","o":["9%","12%","11%","14%"],"a":0,"e":"S = 100, E = 200, I = 300. New income = 192 + 135 = 327, a 9% rise.","qh":"सुधा का खर्च उसकी बचत से 100% अधिक है। यदि उसका खर्च 4% कम हो जाता है और बचत 35% बढ़ जाती है, तो उसकी आय में कितने प्रतिशत की वृद्धि होगी?","oh":["9%","12%","11%","14%"],"eh":"S = 100, E = 200, I = 300। नई आय = 192 + 135 = 327, अर्थात 9% की वृद्धि।"},{"s":"Mathematics","q":"","o":["","","",""],"a":3,"img":"data/img/gd-2026-feb-09-s3/047ma-q0.png","oi":["data/img/gd-2026-feb-09-s3/047ma-o1.png","data/img/gd-2026-feb-09-s3/047ma-o2.png","data/img/gd-2026-feb-09-s3/047ma-o3.png","data/img/gd-2026-feb-09-s3/047ma-o4.png"],"e":"A = 135° and B = 144°. sin²45° + cos³120° = 1/2 + (−1/2)³ = 1/2 − 1/8 = 3/8.","eh":"A = 135° और B = 144°। sin²45° + cos³120° = 1/2 + (−1/2)³ = 1/2 − 1/8 = 3/8।"},{"s":"Mathematics","q":"Rishi can do a piece of work in 12 days. Shan is 20% more efficient than Rishi. The number of days taken by Shan to do the same piece of work is:","o":["10","20","12","15"],"a":0,"e":"Shan works 1.2 times as fast, so 12/1.2 = 10 days.","qh":"ऋषि किसी काम को 12 दिनों में पूरा कर सकता है। शान, ऋषि से 20% अधिक कुशल है। उसी काम को पूरा करने में शान को कितने दिन लगेंगे?","oh":["10","20","12","15"],"eh":"शान 1.2 गुना तेज़ काम करता है, अतः 12/1.2 = 10 दिन।"},{"s":"Mathematics","q":"If the mode of a data exceeds its mean by 34.8, then the mode exceeds the median by _____. (Use empirical formula to find the answer)","o":["21.6","26.9","19.3","23.2"],"a":3,"e":"Mode = 3 Median − 2 Mean, so Mode − Mean = 3(Median − Mean) = 34.8 and Median − Mean = 11.6. Mode − Median = 34.8 − 11.6 = 23.2.","qh":"यदि किसी डेटा का बहुलक उसके माध्य से 34.8 अधिक है, तो बहुलक, माध्यिका से _____ अधिक होगा। (उत्तर ज्ञात करने के लिए आनुभविक सूत्र का उपयोग कीजिए)","oh":["21.6","26.9","19.3","23.2"],"eh":"बहुलक = 3 माध्यिका − 2 माध्य, अतः बहुलक − माध्य = 3(माध्यिका − माध्य) = 34.8 और माध्यिका − माध्य = 11.6। बहुलक − माध्यिका = 34.8 − 11.6 = 23.2।"},{"s":"Mathematics","q":"A rectangular water tank 5 m long and 3 m wide contains water up to a depth of 1.50 m. The area of the wet surface is:","o":["39 m²","54 m²","24 m²","36 m²"],"a":0,"e":"Wet area = base + walls = 5 × 3 + 2(5 + 3) × 1.5 = 15 + 24 = 39 m².","qh":"5 m लंबाई और 3 m चौड़ाई वाली एक आयताकार पानी की टंकी में 1.5 m की गहराई तक पानी भरा हुआ है। गीले पृष्ठ का क्षेत्रफल ज्ञात कीजिए।","oh":["39 m²","54 m²","24 m²","36 m²"],"eh":"गीला क्षेत्रफल = आधार + दीवारें = 5 × 3 + 2(5 + 3) × 1.5 = 15 + 24 = 39 m²।"},{"s":"General Intelligence and Reasoning","q":"Which of the following letter-number clusters will replace the question mark (?) in the given series to make it logically complete? VZY 64 XBA 58 ZDC 52 BFE 46 ?","o":["DHG 40","DGF 39","DIF 40","DHM 39"],"a":0,"e":"Each letter moves +2 (B→D, F→H, E→G) and the number −6, giving DHG 40.","qh":"निम्नलिखित में से कौन-सा अक्षर-संख्या समूह दी गई श्रृंखला को तार्किक रूप से पूर्ण करने के लिए प्रश्न- चिह्न (?) को प्रतिस्थापित करेगा? VZY 64 XBA 58 ZDC 52 BFE 46 ?","oh":["DHG 40","DGF 39","DIF 40","DHM 39"],"eh":"प्रत्येक अक्षर +2 खिसकता है (B→D, F→H, E→G) और संख्या −6, अतः DHG 40।"},{"s":"General Intelligence and Reasoning","q":"QOHY is related to WJLV in a certain way based on the English alphabetical order. In the same way, NRBT is related to TMFQ. To which of the following is JRUF related to following the same logic?","o":["PNZD","PMYC","QMYD","QNZC"],"a":1,"e":"Pattern +6, −5, +4, −3: J→P, R→M, U→Y, F→C gives PMYC.","qh":"अंग्रेजी वर्णमाला क्रम के आधार पर, एक निश्चित तरीके QOHY का संबंध WJLV से है। इसी प्रकार, NRBT का संबंध TMFQ से है। समान तर्क का अनुसरण करते हुए, JRUF का संबंध निम्नलिखित में से किससे है?","oh":["PNZD","PMYC","QMYD","QNZC"],"eh":"पैटर्न +6, −5, +4, −3: J→P, R→M, U→Y, F→C, अतः PMYC।"},{"s":"General Intelligence and Reasoning","q":"What should come in place of the question mark (?) in the given series? 16 31 46 61 76 ?","o":["81","99","91","89"],"a":2,"e":"Each term is +15, so 76 + 15 = 91.","qh":"दी गई श्रृंखला में प्रश्न-चिह्न (?) के स्थान पर क्या आना चाहिए? 16 31 46 61 76 ?","oh":["81","99","91","89"],"eh":"प्रत्येक पद +15 बढ़ता है, अतः 76 + 15 = 91।"},{"s":"General Intelligence and Reasoning","q":"Each of the digits in the number 3652497 is arranged in descending order from left to right. What will be the product of the digits that are second from the left and second from the right in the number thus formed?","o":["21","18","24","14"],"a":0,"e":"Descending order: 9765432. Second from the left is 7 and second from the right is 3, so 7 × 3 = 21.","qh":"यदि संख्या 3652497 के प्रत्येक अंक को बाएं से दाएं अवरोही क्रम में व्यवस्थित किया जाए, तो इस प्रकार बनी संख्या में बाएं से दूसरे अंक और दाएं से दूसरे अंक का गुणनफल क्या होगा?","oh":["21","18","24","14"],"eh":"अवरोही क्रम: 9765432। बाएँ से दूसरा 7 और दाएँ से दूसरा 3 है, अतः 7 × 3 = 21।"},{"s":"General Intelligence and Reasoning","q":"In a certain code language, ‘VOLT’ is coded as ‘6428’ and ‘LIFE’ is coded as ‘5761’. What is the code for ‘L’ in the given code language?","o":["7","2","6","5"],"a":2,"e":"L is the only common letter and 6 the only common digit, so L = 6.","qh":"एक निश्चित कूट भाषा में, 'VOLT' को '6428' के रूप में और 'LIFE' को '5761' के रूप में कूटबद्ध किया जाता है। दी गई कूट भाषा में 'L' का कूट क्या होगा?","oh":["7","2","6","5"],"eh":"L एकमात्र उभयनिष्ठ अक्षर और 6 एकमात्र उभयनिष्ठ अंक है, अतः L = 6।"},{"s":"General Intelligence and Reasoning","q":"Based on the English alphabetical order, three of the following four letter-cluster pairs are alike in a certain way and thus form a group. Which letter-cluster pair DOES NOT belong to that group? (Note: The odd one out is not based on the number of consonants/vowels or their position in the letter-cluster.)","o":["WH - BD","GQ - LN","QK - VH","AE - FB"],"a":0,"e":"The others are +5, −3 (G→L, Q→N). In WH - BD, H→D is −4.","qh":"अंग्रेजी वर्णमाला क्रम के आधार पर, निम्नलिखित चार अक्षर-समूह युग्मों में से तीन एक निश्चित प्रकार से समान हैं और इस प्रकार एक समूह बनाते हैं। कौन-सा अक्षर-समूह युग्म उस समूह से संबंधित नहीं है? (नोट: असंगत अक्षर-समूह व्यंजनों/स्वरों की संख्या या अक्षर-समूह में उनके स्थान पर आधारित नहीं है।)","oh":["WH - BD","GQ - LN","QK - VH","AE - FB"],"eh":"अन्य में +5, −3 है (G→L, Q→N)। WH - BD में H→D, −4 है।"},{"s":"General Intelligence and Reasoning","q":"KGLO is related to QMRU in a certain way based on the English alphabetical order. In the same way, NJOR is related to TPUX. To which of the following is EAFI related to, following the same logic?","o":["KGLP","KHLO","KHLP","KGLO"],"a":3,"e":"Each letter moves +6: E→K, A→G, F→L, I→O gives KGLO.","qh":"अंग्रेजी वर्णमाला के क्रम के आधार पर, एक निश्चित तरीके से KGLO का संबंध QMRU से है। इसी प्रकार, NJOR का संबंध TPUX से है। समान तर्क का अनुसरण करते हुए, EAFI का संबंध निम्नलिखित में से किससे है?","oh":["KGLP","KHLO","KHLP","KGLO"],"eh":"प्रत्येक अक्षर +6 खिसकता है: E→K, A→G, F→L, I→O, अतः KGLO।"},{"s":"General Intelligence and Reasoning","q":"JUNC is related to QBUJ in a certain way based on the English alphabetical order. In the same way, LWPE is related to SDWL. To which of the following options is GRKZ related, following the same logic?","o":["NYRG","NRTU","BNHJ","NGTY"],"a":0,"e":"Each letter moves +7: G→N, R→Y, K→R, Z→G gives NYRG.","qh":"अंग्रेजी वर्णमाला क्रम के आधार पर एक निश्चित तरीके से, JUNC का संबंध QBUJ से है। इसी प्रकार, LWPE का संबंध SDWL से है। समान तर्क के आधार पर, GRKZ का संबंध निम्नलिखित में से किससे है?","oh":["NYRG","NRTU","BNHJ","NGTY"],"eh":"प्रत्येक अक्षर +7 खिसकता है: G→N, R→Y, K→R, Z→G, अतः NYRG।"},{"s":"General Intelligence and Reasoning","q":"What should come in place of (?) in the given series in order to make it logically complete? ED9 HF16 LI25 QM36 ?","o":["WR49","XT49","VR49","WR64"],"a":0,"e":"1st letter +3, +4, +5, +6 (Q→W). 2nd letter +2, +3, +4, +5 (M→R). Numbers are squares 3²…7² = 49. Answer: WR49.","qh":"दी गई श्रृंखला को तार्किक रूप से पूर्ण करने के लिए (?) के स्थान पर क्या आना चाहिए? ED9 HF16 LI25 QM36 ?","oh":["WR49","XT49","VR49","WR64"],"eh":"पहला अक्षर +3, +4, +5, +6 (Q→W)। दूसरा अक्षर +2, +3, +4, +5 (M→R)। संख्याएँ वर्ग हैं 3²…7² = 49। उत्तर: WR49।"},{"s":"General Intelligence and Reasoning","q":"Based on the English alphabetical order, three of the following four letter-cluster pairs are alike in a certain way and thus form a group. Which is the one that does not belong to that group? (Note: The odd man out is not based on the number of consonants/vowels or their position in the letter-cluster.)","o":["DY - IC","SK - XP","JQ - OV","EZ - JE"],"a":0,"e":"The others are +5, +5 (S→X, K→P). In DY - IC, Y→C is +4.","qh":"अंग्रेजी वर्णमाला क्रम पर आधारित, निम्नलिखित चार अक्षर-समूह युग्मों में से तीन किसी निश्चित तरीके से एकसमान हैं और इस प्रकार वे एक ग्रुप बनाते हैं। कौन-सा अक्षर-समूह युग्म, उस ग्रुप से संबंधित नहीं है? (नोट: असंगत अक्षर-समूह युग्म, व्यंजनों/स्वरों की संख्या या उनकी स्थिति पर आधारित नहीं है।)","oh":["DY - IC","SK - XP","JQ - OV","EZ - JE"],"eh":"अन्य में +5, +5 है (S→X, K→P)। DY - IC में Y→C, +4 है।"},{"s":"General Intelligence and Reasoning","q":"Refer to the following number, symbol series and answer the question. Counting to be done from left to right only (all numbers are single digit numbers only). (Left) / 8 & + ^ 1 + < # @ ^ \\ 2 # $ 8 9 * 7 2 $ (Right) How many such numbers are there each of which is immediately preceded by a symbol and also immediately followed by a symbol?","o":["Four","Two","Three","One"],"a":2,"e":"Numbers with a symbol on both sides: 8 (/8&), 1 (^1+) and 2 (\\2#). That makes three.","qh":"निम्नलिखित संख्या, प्रतीक शृंखला का संदर्भ लीजिए और दिए गए प्रश्न का उत्तर दीजिए। गिनती केवल बाएँ से दाएँ की जानी चाहिए। (सभी संख्याएँ केवल एक अंक वाली संख्याएँ हैं)। (बाएँ) / 8 & + ^ 1 + < # @ ^ \\ 2 # $ 8 9 * 7 2 $ (दाएँ) ऐसी कितनी संख्याएँ हैं जिनमें से प्रत्येक के ठीक पहले एक प्रतीक है और ठीक बाद में भी एक प्रतीक है?","oh":["चार","दो","तीन","एक"],"eh":"वे संख्याएँ जिनके दोनों ओर प्रतीक हैं: 8 (/8&), 1 (^1+) और 2 (\\2#)। कुल तीन।"},{"s":"General Intelligence and Reasoning","q":"What will come in the place of the question mark (?) in the following equation, if ‘+’ and ‘−’ are interchanged and ‘×’ and ‘÷’ are interchanged? 154 ÷ 2 − 49 ÷ 7 + 10 × 5 + 28 × 7 − 25 ÷ 5 = ?","o":["618","770","711","662"],"a":1,"e":"Becomes 154 × 2 + 49 × 7 − 10 ÷ 5 − 28 ÷ 7 + 25 × 5 = 308 + 343 − 2 − 4 + 125 = 770.","qh":"यदि ‘+’ और ‘−’ को परस्पर बदल दिया जाए तथा ‘×’ और ‘÷’ को परस्पर बदल दिया जाए, तो निम्नलिखित समीकरण में प्रश्न-चिह्न (?) के स्थान पर क्या आएगा? 154 ÷ 2 − 49 ÷ 7 + 10 × 5 + 28 × 7 − 25 ÷ 5 = ?","oh":["618","770","711","662"],"eh":"यह 154 × 2 + 49 × 7 − 10 ÷ 5 − 28 ÷ 7 + 25 × 5 = 308 + 343 − 2 − 4 + 125 = 770 बन जाता है।"},{"s":"General Intelligence and Reasoning","q":"Refer to the following series and answer the question. (All numbers are single-digit numbers only) (Counting to be done from left to right only). (Left) 3 1 4 1 5 9 2 6 5 3 5 5 7 6 4 3 9 2 8 4 5 5 6 (Right) How many such odd numbers are there, each of which is immediately preceded by an even number and immediately followed by an even number?","o":["One","Two","Three","None"],"a":3,"e":"No odd number has even numbers on both sides, so none.","qh":"निम्नलिखित श्रृंखला का संदर्भ लीजिए और दिए गए प्रश्न का उत्तर दीजिए। (सभी संख्याएं केवल एकल- अंकीय संख्याएं हैं) (गिनती केवल बाएं से दाएं की जानी है)। (बाएं) 3 1 4 1 5 9 2 6 5 3 5 5 7 6 4 3 9 2 8 4 5 5 6 (दाएं) ऐसी कितनी विषम संख्याएं हैं, जिनमें से प्रत्येक के ठीक पहले एक सम संख्या और ठीक बाद में भी एक सम संख्या है?","oh":["एक","दो","तीन","एक भी नहीं"],"eh":"किसी भी विषम संख्या के दोनों ओर सम संख्याएँ नहीं हैं, अतः एक भी नहीं।"},{"s":"General Intelligence and Reasoning","q":"Refer to the following number series and answer the question that follows (all numbers are single-digit numbers only). Counting to be done from left to right only. (Left) 2 9 6 2 7 9 4 5 2 6 9 3 4 4 8 9 7 3 6 1 5 6 6 3 1 6 5 (Right) How many such odd numbers are there, each of which is immediately preceded by an odd number and also immediately followed by an odd number?","o":["2","1","3","0"],"a":1,"e":"Only 9-7-3 has odd numbers on both sides of an odd number. That makes 1.","qh":"निम्नलिखित संख्या शृंखला का संदर्भ लीजिए तथा दिए गए प्रश्न का उत्तर दीजिए। (सभी संख्याएं केवल एकल-अंकीय संख्याएं हैं)। गिनती केवल बाएं से दाएं की जानी है। (बाएं) 2 9 6 2 7 9 4 5 2 6 9 3 4 4 8 9 7 3 6 1 5 6 6 3 1 6 5 (दाएं) ऐसी कितनी विषम संख्याएं हैं, जिनमें से प्रत्येक के ठीक पहले एक विषम संख्या है तथा ठीक बाद भी एक विषम संख्या है?","oh":["2","1","3","0"],"eh":"केवल 9-7-3 में विषम संख्या के दोनों ओर विषम संख्याएँ हैं। कुल 1।"},{"s":"General Intelligence and Reasoning","q":"What should come in place of the question mark (?) in the given series? 89 94 99 104 109 ?","o":["113","114","115","116"],"a":1,"e":"Each term is +5, so 109 + 5 = 114.","qh":"दी गई श्रृंखला में प्रश्न-चिह्न (?) के स्थान पर क्या आना चाहिए? 89 94 99 104 109 ?","oh":["113","114","115","116"],"eh":"प्रत्येक पद +5 बढ़ता है, अतः 109 + 5 = 114।"},{"s":"General Intelligence and Reasoning","q":"Andy ranked 11th from the top and 15th from the bottom in his class. How many students are there in the class?","o":["26","24","27","25"],"a":3,"e":"Total = 11 + 15 − 1 = 25.","qh":"एंडी अपनी कक्षा में ऊपर से 11वें और नीचे से 15वें स्थान पर है। कक्षा में कितने विद्यार्थी हैं?","oh":["26","24","27","25"],"eh":"कुल = 11 + 15 − 1 = 25।"},{"s":"General Intelligence and Reasoning","q":"In a certain code language, A + B means ‘A is the father of B’, A - B means ‘A is the brother of B’, A x B means ‘A is the sister of B’, A ÷ B means ‘A is the wife of B’. Based on the above, how is M related to Q if ‘M + N x O - P ÷ Q’?","o":["Wife’s father","Father","Husband’s brother","Husband’s father"],"a":0,"e":"M is N's father, and N, O, P are siblings. P is Q's wife, so M is Q's wife's father.","qh":"एक निश्चित कूट भाषा में, A + B का अर्थ है कि ‘A, B का पिता है’, A - B का अर्थ है कि ‘A, B का भाई है’, A x B का अर्थ है कि ‘A, B की बहन है’, A ÷ B का अर्थ है कि ‘A, B की पत्नी है’। उपरोक्त के आधार पर, यदि ‘M + N x O - P ÷ Q’ है, तो M का Q से क्या संबंध है?","oh":["पत्नी का पिता","पिता","पति का भाई","पति का पिता"],"eh":"M, N का पिता है, और N, O, P भाई-बहन हैं। P, Q की पत्नी है, अतः M, Q का ससुर है।"},{"s":"General Intelligence and Reasoning","q":"What will come in place of the question mark (?) in the following equation, if ‘+’ and ‘−’ are interchanged and ‘×’ and ‘÷’ are interchanged? 53 ÷ 13 + 391 × 17 − 289 = ?","o":["955","972","963","915"],"a":0,"e":"Becomes 53 × 13 − 391 ÷ 17 + 289 = 689 − 23 + 289 = 955.","qh":"यदि ‘+’ और ‘−’ को परस्पर बदल दिया जाए तथा ‘×’ और ‘÷’ को परस्पर बदल दिया जाए, तो निम्नलिखित समीकरण में प्रश्न-चिह्न (?) के स्थान पर क्या आएगा? 53 ÷ 13 + 391 × 17 − 289 = ?","oh":["955","972","963","915"],"eh":"यह 53 × 13 − 391 ÷ 17 + 289 = 689 − 23 + 289 = 955 बन जाता है।"},{"s":"General Intelligence and Reasoning","q":"This question is based on the five, three-digit numbers given below. (Left) 324 286 472 539 731 (Right) (Example- 697 – First digit = 6, second digit = 9 and third digit = 7) NOTE - All operations to be done from left to right. If all the numbers are arranged in ascending order, the position of how many numbers will remain unchanged?","o":["Three","One","None","Two"],"a":0,"e":"Ascending: 286, 324, 472, 539, 731. 472, 539 and 731 stay in their places, so three.","qh":"यह प्रश्न नीचे दी गई पाँच, तीन-अंकों की संख्या पर आधारित है। (बाएं) 324 286 472 539 731 (दाएं) (उदाहरण- 697 – पहला अंक = 6, दूसरा अंक = 9 और तीसरा अंक = 7) नोट - सभी संक्रियाएं बाएं से दाएं की जानी हैं। यदि सभी संख्याओं को आरोही क्रम में व्यवस्थित किया जाए, तो कितनी संख्याओं की स्थिति अपरिवर्तित रहेगी?","oh":["तीन","एक","एक की भी नहीं","दो"],"eh":"आरोही: 286, 324, 472, 539, 731। 472, 539 और 731 अपने स्थान पर रहती हैं, अतः तीन।"},{"s":"General Intelligence and Reasoning","q":"What should come in place of ‘?’ in the given series? 119 136 155 172 191 ?","o":["208","206","205","210"],"a":0,"e":"Add +17 and +19 alternately: 191 + 17 = 208.","qh":"दी गई शृंखला में ‘?’ के स्थान पर क्या आना चाहिए? 119 136 155 172 191 ?","oh":["208","206","205","210"],"eh":"बारी-बारी से +17 और +19 जोड़ें: 191 + 17 = 208।"},{"s":"General Intelligence and Reasoning","q":"Select the set in which the numbers are related in the same way as are the numbers of the following sets. (NOTE: Operations should be performed on the whole numbers, without breaking down the numbers into their constituent digits. E.g. 13 – Operations on 13 such as adding to/subtracting from/multiplying with 13 can be performed. Breaking down 13 into 1 and 3 and then performing mathematical operations on 1 and 3 is not allowed.) (24, 11, 105) (38, 42, 240)","o":["(34, 62, 286)","(46, 53, 287)","(74, 34, 324)","(93, 12, 318)"],"a":2,"e":"3rd = (1st + 2nd) × 3: (74 + 34) × 3 = 324.","qh":"उस सेट का चयन कीजिए, जिसमें संख्याएं उसी प्रकार संबंधित हैं जैसे कि निम्नलिखित सेटों की संख्याएं संबंधित हैं। (नोट: संख्याओं को उनके घटक अंकों में तोड़े बिना, संक्रियाएं पूर्ण संख्याओं पर की जानी चाहिए। उदाहरण के लिए 13 लीजिए - 13 पर संक्रियाएं जैसे कि 13 में जोड़ना/घटाना/गुणा करना आदि केवल 13 पर की जा सकती है। 13 को 1 और 3 में तोड़ना तथा फिर 1 और 3 पर गणितीय संक्रियाएं करने की अनुमति नहीं है।) (24, 11, 105) (38, 42, 240)","oh":["(34, 62, 286)","(46, 53, 287)","(74, 34, 324)","(93, 12, 318)"],"eh":"तीसरी = (पहली + दूसरी) × 3: (74 + 34) × 3 = 324।"},{"s":"General Intelligence and Reasoning","q":"City A is to the north of City B. City D is to the east of City A. City D is to the south of City E. If City E is to the west of City C, what is the direction of City B with respect to City E?","o":["South West","East","West","North"],"a":0,"e":"B is south of A. A is west of D, and E is north of D, so B lies south-west of E.","qh":"शहर A, शहर B के उत्तर में स्थित है। शहर D, शहर A के पूर्व में स्थित है। शहर D, शहर E के दक्षिण में स्थित है। यदि शहर E, शहर C के पश्चिम में स्थित है, तो शहर E के सापेक्ष शहर B की दिशा क्या होगी?","oh":["दक्षिण-पश्चिम","पूर्व","पश्चिम","उत्तर"],"eh":"B, A के दक्षिण में है। A, D के पश्चिम में है, और E, D के उत्तर में है, अतः B, E के दक्षिण-पश्चिम में है।"},{"s":"General Intelligence and Reasoning","q":"Read the given statements and conclusions carefully. Assuming that the information given in the statements is true, even if it appears to be at variance with commonly known facts, decide which of the given conclusions logically follow(s) from the statements. Statements: All rods are hooks. Some hooks are baits. Conclusions: (I): All rods are baits. (II): Some baits are rods.","o":["Both conclusions (I) and (II) follow","Only conclusion (II) follows","Neither conclusion (I) nor (II) follows","Only conclusion (I) follows"],"a":2,"e":"Rods are linked to baits only through 'some hooks', so neither conclusion follows.","qh":"दिए गए कथनों और निष्कर्षों को ध्यानपूर्वक पढ़िए। यह मानते हुए कि कथनों में दी गई जानकारी सत्य है, भले ही वह सामान्यतः ज्ञात तथ्यों से भिन्न प्रतीत होती हो, तय कीजिए कि दिए गए निष्कर्षों में से कौन- से निष्कर्ष कथनों का तार्किक रूप से अनुसरण करते हैं। कथन: सभी छड़ें, हुक हैं। कुछ हुक, विलोभक हैं। निष्कर्ष: (I): सभी छड़ें, विलोभक हैं। (II): कुछ विलोभक, छड़ें हैं।","oh":["निष्कर्ष (I) और (II) दोनों अनुसरण करते हैं","केवल निष्कर्ष (II) अनुसरण करता है","न तो निष्कर्ष (I) और न ही निष्कर्ष (II) अनुसरण करता है","केवल निष्कर्ष (I) अनुसरण करता है"],"eh":"छड़ें चारे से केवल 'कुछ हुक' के माध्यम से जुड़ी हैं, अतः कोई भी निष्कर्ष अनुसरण नहीं करता।"},{"s":"General Intelligence and Reasoning","q":"Read the given statements and conclusions carefully. You have to take the given statements to be true even if they seem to be at variance from commonly known facts. You have to decide which conclusion/s logically follow/s from the given statements. Statements: All fans are bulbs. Some bulbs are heaters. Some heaters are geysers. Conclusion (I) : Some fans are heaters. Conclusion (II) : Some bulbs are geysers.","o":["Only conclusion (I) follows.","Both conclusions (I) and (II) follow.","Neither conclusion (I) nor (II) follows.","Only conclusion (II) follows."],"a":2,"e":"Fans are not definitely heaters, and bulbs are not definitely geysers, so neither follows.","qh":"दिए गए कथनों और निष्कर्षों को ध्यानपूर्वक पढ़ें। आपको दिए गए कथनों को सत्य मानना है, भले ही वे सामान्य रूप से ज्ञात तथ्यों से भिन्न प्रतीत हों। आपको यह तय करना है कि कौन-सा/से निष्कर्ष, दिए गए कथनों का तार्किक रूप से अनुसरण करता है/करते हैं। कथन: सभी पंखे, बल्ब हैं। कुछ बल्ब, हीटर हैं। कुछ हीटर, गीजर हैं। निष्कर्ष (I): कुछ पंखे, हीटर हैं। निष्कर्ष (II): कुछ बल्ब, गीजर हैं।","oh":["केवल निष्कर्ष (I) अनुसरण करता है।","निष्कर्ष (I) और (II) दोनों अनुसरण करते हैं।","न तो निष्कर्ष (I) और न ही (II) अनुसरण करता है।","केवल निष्कर्ष (II) अनुसरण करता है।"],"eh":"पंखे निश्चित रूप से हीटर नहीं हैं, और बल्ब निश्चित रूप से गीज़र नहीं हैं, अतः कोई भी अनुसरण नहीं करता।"},{"s":"General Intelligence and Reasoning","q":"A, B, C, D, E, F and G are sitting around a circular table facing the centre. D sits to the immediate right of B. E sits third to the right of B. G sits third to the left of D. C is the immediate neighbour of D and E. A is not an immediate neighbour of B. How many people sit between F and D when counted from the left of F?","o":["Five","Three","Four","Two"],"a":2,"e":"Placing everyone gives B, F, G, A, E, C, D going left. Counting from F's left to D, four people sit between them.","qh":"A, B, C, D, E, F और G, एक गोल मेज के परितः केंद्र की ओर अभिमुख होकर बैठे हैं। D, B के दाएं ठीक पड़ोस में बैठा है। E, B के दाएं तीसरे स्थान पर बैठा है। G, D के बाएं तीसरे स्थान पर बैठा है। D और E का निकटतम पड़ोसी C है। A, B का निकटतम पड़ोसी नहीं है। F के बाएं से गिनने पर, F और D के बीच कितने व्यक्ति बैठे हैं?","oh":["पाँच","तीन","चार","दो"],"eh":"सभी को बैठाने पर बाईं ओर क्रम B, F, G, A, E, C, D है। F के बाएँ से D तक गिनने पर उनके बीच चार व्यक्ति बैठे हैं।"},{"s":"General Intelligence and Reasoning","q":"Seven people, S, Q, U, A, R, E and D are sitting in a row, facing north. Only S sits to the left of Q. Only four people sit between S and U. Only A sits between E and R, and E is not an immediate neighbor of U. Who sits at the extreme right of the line?","o":["S","U","A","D"],"a":3,"e":"The order is S, Q, E, A, R, U, D, so D is at the extreme right.","qh":"सात व्यक्ति S, Q, U, A, R, E और D उत्तर दिशा की ओर अभिमुख होकर एक पंक्ति में बैठे हैं। Q के बाईं ओर केवल S बैठा है। S और U के बीच केवल चार व्यक्ति बैठे हैं। E और R के बीच केवल A बैठा है और E, U का निकटतम पड़ोसी नहीं है। पंक्ति के दायें छोर पर कौन बैठा है?","oh":["S","U","A","D"],"eh":"क्रम S, Q, E, A, R, U, D है, अतः D सबसे दाएँ छोर पर है।"},{"s":"General Intelligence and Reasoning","q":"Aarav starts from Point A and drives 13 km towards the East. He then takes a left turn, drives 8 km, turns left and drives 15 km. He then takes a left turn and drives 11 km. He takes a final left turn, drives 2 km and stops at Point P. How far (shortest distance) and towards which direction should he drive in order to reach Point A again? (All turns are 90 degrees turns only unless specified).","o":["4 km to the South","4 km to the North","3 km to the South","3 km to the North"],"a":3,"e":"Net: x = 13 − 15 + 2 = 0 and y = 8 − 11 = −3, so he drives 3 km north.","qh":"आरव, बिंदु A से ड्राइव करना शुरू करता है और पूर्व की ओर 13 km ड्राइव करता है। फिर वह बाएं मुड़ता है और 8 km ड्राइव करता है, वह फिर बाएं मुड़ता है और 15 km ड्राइव करता है। इसके बाद, वह फिर बाएं मुड़ता है और 11 km ड्राइव करता है। अंत में वह बाएं मुड़ता है और 2 km ड्राइव करके बिंदु P पर रुक जाता है। बिंदु A पर वापस पहुँचने के लिए उसे कितनी दूरी (सबसे कम दूरी) तक और किस दिशा में ड्राइव करना चाहिए? (जब तक निर्दिष्ट न किया जाए, सभी मोड़ केवल 90 डिग्री के मोड़ हैं)।","oh":["4 km, दक्षिण की ओर","4 km, उत्तर की ओर","3 km, दक्षिण की ओर","3 km, उत्तर की ओर"],"eh":"शुद्ध: x = 13 − 15 + 2 = 0 और y = 8 − 11 = −3, अतः वह 3 km उत्तर जाता है।"},{"s":"General Intelligence and Reasoning","q":"In a certain code language, ‘she is lovely’ is coded as ‘kl pc cp’ and ‘lovely paint here’ is coded as ‘lk cp no’. How is ‘lovely’ coded in the given language? (All codes are two-letter codes)","o":["kl","pc","cp","no"],"a":2,"e":"'lovely' is the common word and 'cp' is the common code.","qh":"किसी निश्चित कूट भाषा में, ‘she is lovely’ को ‘kl pc cp’ के रूप में कूटबद्ध किया गया है तथा ‘lovely paint here’ को ‘lk cp no’ के रूप में कूटबद्ध किया गया है। दी गई भाषा में ‘lovely’ को किस प्रकार कूटबद्ध किया गया है? (सभी कूट दो-अक्षर वाले कूट हैं)","oh":["kl","pc","cp","no"],"eh":"'lovely' उभयनिष्ठ शब्द है और 'cp' उभयनिष्ठ कूट है।"},{"s":"General Intelligence and Reasoning","q":"All 119 people are standing in a row facing north. Mr. Lkj is 7th from the right end while Mr. Ihg is 29th from the left end. How many people are there between Mr. Lkj and Mr. Ihg?","o":["80","82","83","81"],"a":2,"e":"Lkj is 119 − 7 + 1 = 113th from the left, so between them = 113 − 29 − 1 = 83.","qh":"सभी 119 व्यक्ति उत्तर की ओर अभिमुख होकर एक पंक्ति में खड़े हैं। Lkj दाएँ छोर से 7वें स्थान पर है जबकि Ihg बाएँ छोर से 29वें स्थान पर है। Lkj और Ihg के बीच कितने व्यक्ति हैं?","oh":["80","82","83","81"],"eh":"Lkj बाएँ से 119 − 7 + 1 = 113वाँ है, अतः उनके बीच = 113 − 29 − 1 = 83।"},{"s":"General Intelligence and Reasoning","q":"A, B, C, D, E, F and G are sitting around a circular table facing the centre. E sits third to the left of B. D sits second to the right of B. C sits to the immediate right of F. G sits second to the right of A. How many people sit between G and C when counted from the left of C?","o":["Three","Two","Four","One"],"a":1,"e":"Going left from C: F, E, G… Two people (F and E) sit between C and G.","qh":"A, B, C, D, E, F और G, एक गोल मेज के परितः केंद्र की ओर अभिमुख होकर बैठे हैं। E, B के बाएं तीसरे स्थान पर बैठा है। D, B के दाएं से दूसरे स्थान पर बैठा है। C, F के ठीक दाएं पड़ोस में बैठा है। G, A के दाएं दूसरे स्थान पर बैठा है। C के बाएं से गिनने पर, G और C के बीच कितने व्यक्ति बैठे हैं?","oh":["तीन","दो","चार","एक"],"eh":"C से बाईं ओर: F, E, G… C और G के बीच दो व्यक्ति (F और E) बैठे हैं।"},{"s":"General Awareness and Current Affairs","q":"Under the Viksit Bharat–G RAM G Act 2025, how many days of statutory wage employment are guaranteed per rural household per financial year?","o":["100 days","150 days","125 days","110 days"],"a":2,"e":"The VB–G RAM G Act 2025 guarantees 125 days of wage employment per rural household each year.","qh":"विकसित भारत–G RAM G अधिनियम 2025 के तहत, प्रत्येक ग्रामीण परिवार को प्रति वित्तीय वर्ष कितने दिनों का वैधानिक मजदूरी रोजगार सुनिश्चित है?","oh":["100 दिन","150 दिन","125 दिन","110 दिन"],"eh":"VB–G RAM G अधिनियम 2025 प्रत्येक ग्रामीण परिवार को प्रति वर्ष 125 दिनों के मजदूरी रोजगार की गारंटी देता है।"},{"s":"General Awareness and Current Affairs","q":"Major Dhyan Chand Khel Ratna Award 2024 winner, D Gukesh, is associated with which sports?","o":["Hockey","Chess","Shooting","Badminton"],"a":1,"e":"D. Gukesh, the 2024 World Chess Champion, received the Khel Ratna.","qh":"मेजर ध्यानचंद खेल रत्न पुरस्कार 2024 के विजेता डी. गुकेश किस खेल से संबंधित हैं?","oh":["हॉकी","शतरंज","शूटिंग","बैडमिंटन"],"eh":"2024 के विश्व शतरंज चैंपियन डी. गुकेश को खेल रत्न मिला।"},{"s":"General Awareness and Current Affairs","q":"Which of the following countries hosted the 2025 FIFA U-17 World Cup under the new 48-team format?","o":["Russia","Qatar","Brazil","India"],"a":1,"e":"Qatar hosted the first 48-team FIFA U-17 World Cup in November 2025.","qh":"निम्नलिखित में से किस देश ने नई 48-टीम प्रारूप के अंतर्गत 2025 फीफा U-17 वर्ल्ड कप की मेजबानी की थी?","oh":["रूस","कतर","ब्राज़ील","भारत"],"eh":"कतर ने नवंबर 2025 में पहले 48-टीम वाले FIFA U-17 विश्व कप की मेजबानी की।"},{"s":"General Awareness and Current Affairs","q":"To enhance capabilities in indigenous hydrography, where will the Indian Navy launch INS ‘Ikshak’ in November 2025?","o":["Visakhapatnam","Chennai","Mumbai","Kochi"],"a":3,"e":"INS Ikshak, a Survey Vessel (Large), was commissioned at Kochi in November 2025.","qh":"स्वदेशी हाइड्रोग्राफी (hydrography) में क्षमताओं को बढ़ाने के लिए, भारतीय नौसेना ने नवंबर 2025 में INS इक्षक (Ikshak) को कहाँ कमीशन किया?","oh":["विशाखापत्तनम","चेन्नई","मुंबई","कोच्चि"],"eh":"सर्वेक्षण पोत (बड़ा) INS इक्षक को नवंबर 2025 में कोच्चि में कमीशन किया गया।"},{"s":"General Awareness and Current Affairs","q":"Who set a world record in the men's javelin F42 category at the Nottwil World Para Athletics Grand Prix in Switzerland, winning the gold medal?","o":["Mahendra Gurjar","Rinku Solanki","Devender Singh","Praveen Kumar"],"a":0,"e":"Mahendra Gurjar set the F42 javelin world record at the Nottwil Grand Prix 2025.","qh":"स्विट्जरलैंड में आयोजित 'नॉटविल वर्ल्ड पैरा एथलेटिक्स ग्रैंड प्रिक्स' में पुरुषों की भाला फेंक F42 श्रेणी में किसने विश्व रिकॉर्ड बनाते हुए स्वर्ण पदक जीता?","oh":["महेंद्र गुर्जर","रिंकू सोलंकी","देवेन्द्र सिंह","प्रवीण कुमार"],"eh":"महेंद्र गुर्जर ने नॉटविल ग्रां प्री 2025 में F42 भाला फेंक का विश्व रिकॉर्ड बनाया।"},{"s":"General Awareness and Current Affairs","q":"Which British honours list, including overseas recognitions, was published on 13 June 2025?","o":["Queen’s Platinum Overseas & International List","UK Civil Service Honors List","King’s Birthday Honours Overseas & International List","New Year Honours 2025"],"a":2,"e":"The King's Birthday Honours 2025 Overseas & International List was published on 13 June 2025.","qh":"विदेशी मान्यताओं सहित कौन-सी ब्रिटिश सम्मान सूची (British honours list) 13 जून 2025 को प्रकाशित हुई थी?","oh":["कीन्स प्लेटिनम ओवरसीज एंड इंटरनेशनल लिस्ट (Queen’s Platinum Overseas & International List)","यूके सिविल सर्विस ऑनर्स लिस्ट (UK Civil Service Honors List)","किंग्स बर्थडे ऑनर्स ओवरसीज एंड इंटरनेशनल लिस्ट (King’s Birthday Honours Overseas & International List)","न्यू ईयर ऑनर्स 2025 (New Year Honours 2025)"],"eh":"किंग्स बर्थडे ऑनर्स 2025 की ओवरसीज़ एवं इंटरनेशनल सूची 13 जून 2025 को प्रकाशित हुई।"},{"s":"General Awareness and Current Affairs","q":"The inaugural plenary session of the Indian Conservation Conference–2025 was held at which institution in June 2025?","o":["Indian Institute of Science, Bengaluru","Wildlife Institute of India, Dehradun","Indian Council of Forestry Research, Jabalpur","Forest Research Institute, Dehradun"],"a":1,"e":"The Indian Conservation Conference 2025 opened at the Wildlife Institute of India, Dehradun.","qh":"जून 2025 में भारतीय संरक्षण सम्मेलन–2025 (Indian Conservation Conference–2025) का उद्घाटन पूर्ण सत्र किस संस्थान में आयोजित किया गया था?","eh":"इंडियन कंज़र्वेशन कॉन्फ्रेंस 2025 भारतीय वन्यजीव संस्थान, देहरादून में शुरू हुई।"},{"s":"General Awareness and Current Affairs","q":"Which seat did Congress win in the Kerala by-elections in June 2025?","o":["Ernakulam","Wayanad","Kottayam","Nilambur"],"a":3,"e":"Congress (UDF) won the Nilambur bypoll in June 2025.","qh":"जून 2025 में केरल उपचुनाव में कांग्रेस ने कौन-सी सीट जीती?","oh":["एर्नाकुलम","वायनाड","कोट्टायम","निलाम्बुर"],"eh":"जून 2025 में नीलांबुर उपचुनाव कांग्रेस (UDF) ने जीता।"},{"s":"General Awareness and Current Affairs","q":"Which prestigious award was Dr. Anandharamakrishnan awarded in 2024 for his contributions to Agricultural Sciences?","o":["Shanti Swarup Bhatnagar Prize","Bharat Ratna","Vigyan Shri Award","Padma Bhushan"],"a":2,"e":"Dr. C. Anandharamakrishnan received the Vigyan Shri (Agricultural Science) in 2024.","qh":"कृषि विज्ञान में उनके योगदान के लिए डॉ. आनंदरामकृष्णन को 2024 में कौन-सा प्रतिष्ठित पुरस्कार दिया गया?","oh":["शांति स्वरूप भटनागर पुरस्कार","भारत रत्न","विज्ञान श्री पुरस्कार","पद्म भूषण"],"eh":"डॉ. सी. आनंदरामकृष्णन को 2024 में विज्ञान श्री (कृषि विज्ञान) मिला।"},{"s":"General Awareness and Current Affairs","q":"Which of the following administrative institutions of India completed 100 years of service in 2025?","o":["Election Commission of India (ECI)","Central Bureau of Investigation (CBI)","Union Public Service Commission (UPSC)","Central Vigilance Commission (CVC)"],"a":2,"e":"The UPSC, set up on 1 Oct 1926, entered its centenary year in 2025.","qh":"भारत की निम्नलिखित में से किस प्रशासनिक संस्था ने 2025 में 100 वर्ष की सेवा पूरी की?","oh":["भारत निर्वाचन आयोग (ECI)","केंद्रीय अन्वेषण ब्यूरो (CBI)","संघ लोक सेवा आयोग (UPSC)","केंद्रीय सतर्कता आयोग (CVC)"],"eh":"1 अक्टूबर 1926 को स्थापित UPSC ने 2025 में अपने शताब्दी वर्ष में प्रवेश किया।"},{"s":"General Awareness and Current Affairs","q":"In 2025, 36 people including government employees were arrested under “Operation Spot Trap” by the Vigilance and Anti‑Corruption Bureau (VACB). Which state was this operation conducted in?","o":["Maharashtra","Kerala","Uttar Pradesh","Rajasthan"],"a":1,"e":"Operation Spot Trap was run by Kerala's VACB.","qh":"2025 में, सतर्कता एवं भ्रष्टाचार निरोधक ब्यूरो (VACB) द्वारा \"ऑपरेशन स्पॉट ट्रैप\" के अंतर्गत सरकारी कर्मचारियों सहित 36 लोगों को गिरफ्तार किया गया था। यह अभियान किस राज्य में चलाया गया था?","oh":["महाराष्ट्र","केरल","उत्तर प्रदेश","राजस्थान"],"eh":"ऑपरेशन स्पॉट ट्रैप केरल के VACB द्वारा चलाया गया।"},{"s":"General Awareness and Current Affairs","q":"In May 2025, the Reserve Bank of India (RBI) penalised the Union Bank of India and which of the following companies?","o":["Broadridge Financial Solutions","Paytm","Razorpay","Transactree Technologies"],"a":3,"e":"In May 2025 the RBI penalised Union Bank of India and Transactree Technologies (Lendbox).","qh":"मई 2025 में, भारतीय रिजर्व बैंक (RBI) ने यूनियन बैंक ऑफ इंडिया और निम्नलिखित में से किस कंपनी पर जुर्माना लगाया?","oh":["ब्रॉडरिज फाइनेंशियल सॉल्यूशंस (Broadridge Financial Solutions)","पेटीएम (Paytm)","रेज़रपे (Razorpay)","ट्रांसैक्ट्री टेक्नोलॉजीज (Transactree Technologies)"],"eh":"मई 2025 में RBI ने यूनियन बैंक ऑफ इंडिया और ट्रांजैक्ट्री टेक्नोलॉजीज़ (Lendbox) पर जुर्माना लगाया।"},{"s":"General Awareness and Current Affairs","q":"Which of the following former AIFF officials, who also held key positions in various sports associations in Nagaland, passed away in 2025?","o":["Savio Medeira","Bhaichung Bhutia","Atuo Mezhür","Subrata Dutta"],"a":2,"e":"Atuo Mezhür, former AIFF official and Nagaland sports administrator, died in 2025.","qh":"निम्नलिखित में से कौन-से पूर्व AIFF अधिकारी, जिन्होंने नागालैंड में विभिन्न खेल संघों में भी महत्वपूर्ण पदों पर कार्य किया था, का निधन 2025 में हुआ?","oh":["सेवियो मेडेरा (Savio Medeira)","बाईचुंग भूटिया (Bhaichung Bhutia)","अतूओ मेज़ुर (Atuo Mezhür)","सुब्रत दत्ता (Subrata Dutta)"],"eh":"पूर्व AIFF अधिकारी और नागालैंड के खेल प्रशासक अतुओ मेझुर का 2025 में निधन हुआ।"},{"s":"General Awareness and Current Affairs","q":"Which athlete received the Laureus World Sportswoman of the Year in 2025?","o":["Serena Williams","Ellesse Andrews","Rebeca Andrade","Simone Biles"],"a":3,"e":"Simone Biles won the Laureus World Sportswoman of the Year award in 2025.","qh":"किस एथलीट ने 2025 में लॉरियस वर्ल्ड स्पोर्ट्सवुमेन ऑफ द ईयर (Laureus World Sportswoman of the Year) पुरस्कार प्राप्त किया?","oh":["सेरेना विलियम्स (Serena Williams)","एल्से एंड्रयूज (Ellesse Andrews)","रेबेका एंड्रेड (Rebeca Andrade)","सिमोन बाइल्स (Simone Biles)"],"eh":"सिमोन बाइल्स ने 2025 में लॉरियस वर्ल्ड स्पोर्ट्सवुमन ऑफ द ईयर पुरस्कार जीता।"},{"s":"General Awareness and Current Affairs","q":"Which state government implemented an environmental tax on out-of-state vehicles starting December 2025?","o":["Sikkim","Himachal Pradesh","Uttarakhand","Assam"],"a":2,"e":"Uttarakhand began levying a green tax on out-of-state vehicles from December 2025.","qh":"किस राज्य सरकार ने दिसंबर 2025 से दूसरे राज्यों के वाहनों पर पर्यावरण कर (environmental tax) लागू किया है?","eh":"उत्तराखंड ने दिसंबर 2025 से अन्य राज्यों के वाहनों पर हरित कर लगाना शुरू किया।"},{"s":"General Awareness and Current Affairs","q":"Which of the following Indian states features the defence industrial corridor that attracted investment proposals worth ₹33,896 crore in 2025?","o":["Tamil Nadu","Maharashtra","Gujarat","Uttar Pradesh"],"a":3,"e":"The Uttar Pradesh Defence Industrial Corridor drew proposals worth ₹33,896 crore.","qh":"निम्नलिखित में से किस भारतीय राज्य में रक्षा औद्योगिक गलियारा है, जिसने 2025 में ₹33,896 करोड़ के निवेश प्रस्तावों को आकर्षित किया है?","oh":["तमिलनाडु","महाराष्ट्र","गुजरात","उत्तर प्रदेश"],"eh":"उत्तर प्रदेश रक्षा औद्योगिक गलियारे को ₹33,896 करोड़ के प्रस्ताव मिले।"},{"s":"General Awareness and Current Affairs","q":"According to the Economic Survey released in January 2025, India was identified as the seventh most vulnerable country to climate change. What percentage of days in 2024 were marked by significant climate events such as heatwaves, cyclones and floods?","o":["90%","85%","93%","95%"],"a":2,"e":"The Economic Survey said significant climate events hit India on 93% of days in 2024.","qh":"जनवरी 2025 में जारी आर्थिक समीक्षा के अनुसार, भारत को जलवायु परिवर्तन के प्रति सातवां सबसे संवेदनशील देश बताया गया है। वर्ष 2024 में कितने प्रतिशत दिनों में गर्म हवाएं, चक्रवात और बाढ़ जैसी महत्वपूर्ण जलवायु घटनाएं देखी गईं?","oh":["90%","85%","93%","95%"],"eh":"आर्थिक समीक्षा के अनुसार 2024 में 93% दिनों में भारत में महत्वपूर्ण जलवायु घटनाएँ हुईं।"},{"s":"General Awareness and Current Affairs","q":"What change did the Banking Laws (Amendment) Act, notified in April 2025, make regarding bank nominee rules?","o":["Allowed up to four nominees","Removed nomination option","Made nomination optional","Allowed only one nominee"],"a":0,"e":"The Banking Laws (Amendment) Act 2025 lets depositors name up to four nominees.","qh":"अप्रैल 2025 में अधिसूचित, बैंकिंग कानून (संशोधन) अधिनियम ने बैंक नॉमिनी नियमों के संबंध में क्या परिवर्तन किए?","eh":"बैंकिंग विधि (संशोधन) अधिनियम 2025 जमाकर्ताओं को अधिकतम चार नामित व्यक्ति रखने की अनुमति देता है।"},{"s":"General Awareness and Current Affairs","q":"What is its primary objective of the GoIStats app, launched by the Ministry of Statistics and Programme Implementation (MoSPI) in 2025?","o":["To offer real-time agricultural weather forecasts to farmers","To give a snapshot of key socio-economic data of the Ministry","To facilitate online shopping and digital payment services","To provide entertainment content and cultural heritage updates"],"a":1,"e":"MoSPI's GoIStats app gives a snapshot of key socio-economic statistics.","qh":"सांख्यिकी और कार्यक्रम कार्यान्वयन मंत्रालय (MoSPI) द्वारा 2025 में लॉन्च किए गए GoIStats ऐप का प्राथमिक उद्देश्य क्या है?","eh":"MoSPI का GoIStats ऐप प्रमुख सामाजिक-आर्थिक आँकड़ों की झलक देता है।"},{"s":"General Awareness and Current Affairs","q":"In February 2025, which Indian athlete broke the Asian short-track record in the 5000 m with a time of 12:59.77?","o":["Jacob Kiplimo","Yared Nuguse","Avinash Sable","Gulveer Singh"],"a":3,"e":"Gulveer Singh set an Asian indoor 5000m record of 12:59.77 in February 2025.","qh":"फरवरी 2025 में, किस भारतीय एथलीट ने 5000 m रेस में 12:59.77 के समय के साथ एशियाई शॉर्ट- ट्रैक (Asian short-track) रिकॉर्ड तोड़ा?","oh":["जैकब किप्लिमो","यारेड नुगुसे","अविनाश साबले","गुलवीर सिंह"],"eh":"गुलवीर सिंह ने फरवरी 2025 में 12:59.77 का एशियाई इंडोर 5000m रिकॉर्ड बनाया।"}]});
